      "chapter": "compare",
      "spoken": "For an at-least question, the upper bound is the total number of trials. For an at-most question, the lower bound is zero.",
      "coach": "At least five includes 5 through 12. At most five includes 0 through 5.",
      "end": 31.55,
      "hold": 6,
      "keys": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": "compare",
      "spoken": "A strict inequality leaves its boundary out. Move to the next included whole number before you enter the bounds.",
      "coach": "More than five starts at 6: the count 5 does not belong in the event.",
      "end": 39.079,
      "hold": 6,
